namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTiltCard {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard
    src   "Tilts the widget towards the pointer in 3D, on a spring: the edge under the pointer dips away, it grows a little while the\npointer is over it, and swings back flat when the pointer leaves. Through the widget's render transform, so layout is left\nas it is; put it inside a perspective scope (UDreamWidget's Perspective, on a parent) for the tilt to foreshorten.\n\nThe tilt it is at (GetTilt) is what a holo foil on the same widget (UDreamHoloFoil) can take its angle of view from."
    text  "以弹簧效果让控件在3D中朝指针倾斜：指针下方的边缘会下沉远离，指针悬停其上时控件会略微\n放大，指针离开后则回弹至水平。通过控件的渲染变换实现，因此布局保持\n不变；请将其放在透视作用域内（父级上UDreamWidget的Perspective），倾斜才会产生透视缩短。\n\n它当前的倾斜（GetTilt）可作为同一控件上全息箔（UDreamHoloFoil）的视角依据。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:bEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:bEnabled
    src   "Off, the card lies flat: to compare with and without it."
    text  "关闭时卡片保持水平：用于对比开启与关闭的效果。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:GetTilt {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:GetTilt
    src   "The tilt it is at now, -1..1 across and up: the spring's, not the pointer's."
    text  "当前的倾斜值，横向和纵向均为-1..1：这是弹簧的值，而非指针的值。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:HoverScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:HoverScale
