    text  "指针悬停在其上时的放大程度。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:IsEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:IsEnabled
    src   "Where it tilts to when it does not follow the pointer: -1..1 across and up its rect, (0, 0) flat."
    text  "不跟随指针时的倾斜目标：在其矩形范围内横向和纵向均为-1..1，(0, 0)表示水平。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:MaxAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:MaxAngle
    src   "The most it tilts, degrees, with the pointer at an edge."
    text  "指针位于边缘时的最大倾斜角度（单位：度）。"
    state machine
}

DreamTiltCard:SetEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamTiltCard.h#DreamTiltCard:SetEnabled
    src   "Off, the card settles flat and at its own size, and stays there until it is turned on."
    text  "关闭时，卡片会恢复为水平并保持自身大小，且在重新开启前一直如此。"
    state machine
}

